  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a sequence of integers representing a player's scores. Positive integers contribute to the total score.\n\nThe input ends when the user enters a non-positive value (0 or negative).\n\nYour task is to write a program to calculate and print the total sum of all positive scores.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nA sequence of integers, one per line.\nThe input terminates when a 0 or negative integer is entered.\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nPrint the total positive score as:\n\n`Total positive score: X`\n\nwhere `X` is the sum of all positive integers entered.",
